view pending"},"source":{"id":"ENG7-U01-MB-READ-B","kind":"reading","format":"passage","familyId":"546febe1-e048-5fc7-b66d-2023f636dc5c","title":"Reading source MB-B","locale":"en","text":"According to the Fashion and Design Chamber of Armenia, SHABEEG uses clothing to share Armenian heritage. Nature, architecture and traditional dress provide ideas for its designs. Its products include T-shirts as well as other clothes and bags.\n\nThe profile describes a clear design sequence: the pictures are first drawn by hand and then turned into digital images. Traditional sources of inspiration and a later digital step are both part of the account.","sourceReferences":["https://www.fdc.am/designers/6"],"reviewStatus":"pending","registrationStatus":"unregistered","audioAvailable":false}}},{"itemId":"3906ff32-0913-5ae7-a44c-2fb712a31b39","itemCode":"ENG7-U01-MB-24","context":{"schemaVersion":"haiedu-authoring-review-v1","itemCode":"ENG7-U01-MB-24","version":1,"locale":"en","sourcePacket":"docs/content/english-7-unit-01-assessment-batch-bcd.json","sourceReference":"Grigoryan, English 7, Zangak 2023; pp. 16, 20, 21; activities 18, 21, 22; programme T1.K2, T1.L2; docs/content/english-7-unit-01-assessment-batch-bcd.json#ENG7-U01-MB-24","hint":"Use the supplied information and preserve its meaning.","feedback":"The passage names Armenian nature, architecture and traditional dress.","optionFeedback":[{"key":"a","text":"The passage names different sources of inspiration."},{"key":"b","text":"These are the three influences stated."},{"key":"c","text":"The account is broader than a monthly colour trend."}],"fieldFeedback":[],"comparison":{"disposition":"protected_parallel_assessment_variant","protocol":"haiedu-protected-parallel-pilot-v1","authorization":"docs/evidence/english-7-unit-01-owner-acceptance-20261021.json","repeatedTaughtClaim":"Supported cultural information from READ-B","nearestPractice":["ENG7-U01-R01","ENG7-U01-R03","ENG7-U01-R07","ENG7-U01-R08"],"nearestExistingAssessm